<file path="docs/api-polling-audit.md">
# API polling audit

| Endpoint/hook                        |                             Current polling interval | Mounted from                                         | Necessary?                              | Change made                                                    | Final behavior                                                                            |
| ------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------: | ---------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `useCpu` `/api/system/cpu/`          |                                                   2s | Dashboard CPU widget                                 | Yes, live metric                        | Retained; disabled background and focus refetch                | Polls only while widget is mounted and tab visible                                        |
| `useMemory` `/api/system/memory/`    |                                                   2s | Dashboard Memory widget                              | Yes, live metric                        | Retained; disabled background and focus refetch                | Polls only while widget is mounted and tab visible                                        |
| `useNetwork` bandwidth endpoints     |                                                   2s | Dashboard Network/settings table                     | Yes for dashboard bandwidth             | Retained; disabled background and focus refetch                | Polls bandwidth only after network details load and while observer is mounted/tab visible |
| `useZpool` `/api/zpool/`             |                                          default 30s | Dashboard, Integrated Storage, startup notifications | Yes for pool health                     | Restored 30s default with background polling off               | Polls while mounted/tab visible unless a caller overrides the interval                    |
| Integrated Storage zpool list        |                                                  30s | `/Integrated-space`                                  | Useful while storage page is open       | Retained explicit page interval; removed manual refresh button | Polls only on route with background polling off                                           |
| `usePoolDeviceSlots`                 |                                          default 30s | Integrated Storage, Server 3D                        | Only when slots UI/widget active        | Restored 30s default with background polling off               | Polls only when enabled, mounted, and tab visible; 3D widget overrides slots to 10s       |
| Partitioned disks                    |                                                   5s | create/add/replace pool modals                       | Modal-only                              | Kept enabled only while modal is open                          | Stops when modals close                                                                   |
| Pool details queries                 |                                                  30s | selected/pinned pool details                         | Only when details visible               | Kept conditional on active/pinned ids                          | No details polling before row selection                                                   |
| `useServices` `/api/system/service/` |                                                   5s | Services page                                        | Static admin list                       | Removed interval                                               | Refetches on mount and mutation invalidation                                              |
| `useServiceStatuses`                 |                                                   5s | Services table status observers                      | Useful for service status after actions | Retained                                                       | Polls only while services page/table is mounted                                           |
| `useVolumes` `/api/volume/`          |                                                  15s | Block storage page                                   | Static admin list                       | Removed interval                                               | Refetches on mount and mutation invalidation                                              |
| `useSambaShares`                     |                                                 none | SMB page                                             | No continuous polling                   | No change                                                      | Fetches on mount/invalidation                                                             |
| `useSystemInfo` `/api/system/info`   |                                                  30s | System info widget/layout                            | Mostly static                           | Removed interval                                               | Fetches on mount/invalidation                                                             |
| Startup notification checks          | none direct, used `useZpool({ refetchInterval: 0 })` | Notification bootstrapper                            | Run once per user lifecycle             | Preserved with refetchInterval: 0 override                     | No duplicate interval introduced                                                          |
| Session/countdown timers             |                                      1s local timers | Layout/session hooks                                 | UI-only timers                          | No API polling                                                 | No API requests                                                                           |

## Polling intentionally retained

CPU, memory and network bandwidth remain live dashboard metrics. Pool hooks again default to 30s polling for live pool health, with React Query observers stopping automatically when their components unmount and background-tab polling disabled. Integrated Storage pool-detail polling remains selection scoped so no detail polling occurs before explicit row selection. Pool-device slots poll only when enabled/mounted; the 3D server widget keeps its 10s slot override while its zpool list uses the restored 30s cadence.
</file>

